  "content": "<h1>🔄 預設遊戲模式 🎮</h1>\n<p>此模組讓你在建立新世界時，可以變更預設的世界遊戲模式（生存、極限生存、創意、觀察者）。它不會改變既有世界的遊戲模式！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"quilt\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Alfakynz/Default-Gamemode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fidPolUDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-gamemode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TcmUQHZ5U4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p>\n<h2>✨ 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在建立新世界時變更預設遊戲模式</li>\n<li>支援所有遊戲模式：生存、極限生存、創意和觀察者</li>\n<li>包含設定選項，可配置將哪種遊戲模式設為預設值（需搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>）</li>\n<li>與 <a href=\"https://github.com/Keksuccino/ModernWorldCreation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern World Creation</a> 相容</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔄 版本需求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minecraft &gt;= 1.20</li>\n<li>Fabric &gt;= 0.16.4</li>\n<li>Quilt &gt;= 0.17.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🚀 預計功能</h2>\n<p>目前沒有其他計劃，但歡迎提出任何你想要的功能建議！</p>\n<h2>📦 整合包</h2>\n<p>歡迎將 Better Slots 納入你的整合包中。</p>\n<h2>🌐 正在尋找伺服器？同時支持我！</h2>\n<p>想和朋友一起玩嗎？透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wabbanode</a> 擁有你自己的伺服器。</p>\n<p>使用代碼 <strong>WILDLIGHT</strong> 以支持我並獲得 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fwildlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hvk4z0Vv/banner-3.png\" alt=\"Wabbanode server\"></a></p>",
